*
* Updates:
*
* Final 1.10
* <Made these changes to the model>
*  1. Updated model to take care of tWDU value when SET1 is toggled 
*
*
* Final 1.00
* Release to Web
*
*****************************************************************************
*
* Model Usage Notes:
*
* 1. The following features have been modelled
*   a.  VCC thresholds(POR and BG_OK).  
*   b.  Fixed Reset Delay. 
*   c.  User programmable Watchdog timeout. 
*   d.  SET1 pin functionality to enable/disable watchdog
*   e.  Supply voltage vs Supply current graph
*   f.  VOL vs Resetbar current graph.
*   g.  Propagation delay vs Overdrive graph.
*      
* 2.a. Temperature effects are not been modelled.
*   b. Model doesn't support inverting configuration as GND pin is internally connected to '0'V.
*  
*  Note:
*    An extra Parameter Xyy is used in  the model  to make model  generic for different device nomenclature 
*     Where X= nominal  thresholds  as a percent of the nominal  monitored  voltage 
*     If X=0,  then G, 
*     If X=1,  then H,
*     And parameter yy=nominal  monitored  voltage  option. 
*     So, user can select device as mention  below 
*      If Xyy=033  then device is TPS3851G33 
*      If Xyy=118  then device is TPS3851H18 
*     
*
*****************************************************************************
